{"page":191,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:27","surah":9,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ يَتُوبُ ٱللَّهُ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but God turns in His mercy to whoever He will. God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتُوبُ","en_gloss":"Allah accepts repentance","transliteration":"yatūbu","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah accepts repentance","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"9:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:27"}]},{"verse_key":"9:28","surah":9,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَا ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ نَجَسٌ فَلَا يَقْرَبُوا۟ ٱلْمَسْجِدَ ٱلْحَرَامَ بَعْدَ عَامِهِمْ هَـٰذَا ۚ وَإِنْ خِفْتُمْ عَيْلَةً فَسَوْفَ يُغْنِيكُمُ ٱللَّهُ مِن فَضْلِهِۦٓ إِن شَآءَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, those who ascribe partners to God are truly unclean: do not let them come near the Sacred Mosque after this year. If you are afraid you may become poor, [bear in mind that] God will enrich you out of His bounty if He pleases: God is all knowing and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikūna","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَجَسٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) unclean","transliteration":"najasun","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so let them not come near","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَقْرَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"so let them not come near","transliteration":"yaqrabū","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-masjida","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","en_gloss":"Al-Masjid Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَامِهِمْ","en_gloss":"this, their (final) year","transliteration":"ʿāmihim","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هَـٰذَا ۚ","en_gloss":"this, their (final) year","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خِفْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"khif'tum","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَيْلَةًۭ","en_gloss":"poverty","transliteration":"ʿaylatan","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"then soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُغْنِيكُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah will enrich you","transliteration":"yugh'nīkumu","verse_key":"9:28"},{"pos